  "description": "In the game I had 2 gts, 1 assault tank, missle scout, spare sabre, and a truck but he got it because my own ai killed me and he could dump his ammo on the rec. Were arguing about the wrong shit. Its not about how to stop it, its that it shouldnt be POSSIBLE at all. There should not be enough scavs possible due to unit limit to do it because its stupid as fuck and has continued to be a problem, people trying to do it to me over and over in 1v1s and strats, they either lose because of it or they, through virtue of having better teams, sit and camp my team with lase while waiting for the scavs. In both cases it degrades our strats and makes them a waste of time. Also consider the fact that a player of his \"cailbre\" can beat me with it, what a joke of a mechanic.\r\n\r\n6 pools\r\nMedium Size\r\n430 loose, spread out. \r\nNo base pool. \r\n\r\nMap by Gravey",
